## 🧠 My Initial Understanding

This level was much simpler to handle, even for a script kiddie like me: get in, open list, deploy concatanation, harvesting password

## What did I notice first?

bandit terminal changes when the level changes. It takes the name of the previous ternimal you just cleared. 
eg: if one proceeded from 0 to 1, username will be bandit0@bandit, from 1 to 2 it becomes bandit1@bandit.

## 💻 Commands Used
command 1: ls- opens the list of the files inside a directory
command 2: cat- opens the file

